  "description": "Platform MCP stdio server (ironbrain-mcp) for Cursor and other bots.\n      Authenticates as an Ironbrain account (Supabase JWT) and enqueues HITL Outbox actions\n      via Ironbrain.Api — bots never hold IMAP/SMTP adapter secrets.\n      Distinct from Ironbrain.MailCal.Mcp (public ironbrain-mailcal product).",
