  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.17 — stdio host exits when the parent/client process is gone (parent-PID watch) in\naddition to stdin EOF, so orphaned ironbrain-mcp instances do not linger (or spin) after\nthe MCP client disconnects. See #147.\n0.2.16 — list_mailboxes (AllowAlways read) + enqueue_create_mailbox (RequireHitl write;\nidempotent IMAP CREATE). Requires Ironbrain.Email 0.1.15.\n0.2.15 — enqueue_add/update_appointment: send startText/endText (original strings) so the API\ninterprets offset-less times as wall-clock in timeZoneId (default Europe/Berlin). Avoids\nDateTimeOffset JSON attaching +00:00 on UTC hosts (events were 1h late).\n0.2.14 — CAP propose: when status ≠ pending_approval return error + reasonCode and NO approvalUrl\n(fixes published 0.2.13 which still linked Freigabe on failed proposals). OpenAI CAP failures\nsurface openai_insufficient_quota vs openai_rate_limit (and openai_http_error) from errorMessage.\n0.2.13 — CAP-Dynamic: propose_capability / list_capability_proposals / get_capability_proposal /\nreject_capability_proposal (+ approval URL). create_connector / enable_connector documented as\nUI hard-floored (403 for MCP); prefer propose_capability.\n0.2.12 — enqueue_add_appointment / enqueue_update_appointment: optional allDay (VALUE=DATE,\nexclusive end yyyy-MM-dd). list_appointments returns allDay + date-only start/end. Requires\nIronbrain.Calendar 0.1.13.\n0.2.11 — list_actions: Outbox history with status/since/type/accountId/decision filters + paging\n(ACT-History). Slim list projection (no payloadJson / resultJson / grantToken).\n0.2.10 — MAIL-Triage + post-#82 follow-ups: list_emails filters + totalCount/nextOffset;\nenqueue_move/archive emailIds (bulk, same HITL); get_email In-Reply-To/References + HTTP 404\nfor missing UID; enqueue_add_appointment recurrence (RRULE / daily|weekly+count|until);\nomitted timeZoneId defaults to Europe/Berlin (no floating offset drop). Requires Email/Calendar 0.1.7.\nlist_emails returns page object {items,totalCount,offset,limit,nextOffset} (not a bare array).\n0.2.9 — Per-action Freigabe deep links: approvalUrl / approvalMarkdown on pending enqueue_*,\nget_action, and each list_pending_actions item (/outbox/{actionId} from PublicWebBaseUrl).\n0.2.8 — External-recipient HITL hard floor: enqueue_send_email Cc/Bcc; capabilities\nexternalSendRequiresUiApproval; MCP-scoped tokens cannot confirm external sends.\n0.2.7 — enqueue_update_appointment / enqueue_delete_appointment (partial CalDAV update +\ndelete; recurrenceId for one occurrence; update AllowAuto ~0.8, delete RequireHitl).\nlist_appointments returns recurrenceId / isRecurring.\n0.2.6 — Polish local OAuth callback page (127.0.0.1:8765/callback): branded success/error\nUI with CTA to https://app.ironbrain.de.\n0.2.5 — enqueue_save_draft (SaveDraft HITL; IMAP APPEND \\\\Draft; From=IMAP identity).\nget_email returns To, Cc, Message-ID (via API/mailcal 0.1.3).\n0.2.4 — enqueue_forward_email (ForwardEmail HITL; original attachments fetched on confirm).\n0.2.3 — Catch up NuGet tool surface with HTTP MCP (POST /api/mcp): connector admin\ntools, enqueue_mcp_tool, enqueue_trash_email, reject_action. Document bot bootstrap:\nwhoami.capabilitiesSummary + list_available_actions. Prefer platform MCP over MailCal\nwhen the same capability exists. Includes 0.2.2 OAuth redirect_uri fix.\n0.2.2 — Fix OAuth authorize URL redirect_uri double-encoding (invalid_redirect_uri).\nBuild authorize query with a single EscapeDataString pass; open browser via argv\n(/usr/bin/open) instead of UseShellExecute FileName=url. Reject already-encoded\nIRONBRAIN_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI. Default OAuth scopes → openid only until custom\nironbrain.* scopes are registered on the Supabase OAuth client (unsupported scope\notherwise). See docs/mcp-oauth.md.\n0.2.1 — get_action + Freigabe read grant surface (code from #36; package bump for nuget.org).",
